---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact"><section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">A personal conversation</p><h1>What’s your<br/>next ride?</h1><div class="contact"><div><p>Bicycles, wheels, a custom build or a possible partnership. A good place to start is a conversation.</p><h3>Scandinavian inquiries</h3><p>Denmark · Sweden · Norway</p><p>Representative contact details will be added before launch. This prototype form lets you explore the experience without sending a message.</p></div><InquiryForm kind="contact"/></div></section></Layout>
<style>.contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:100px;padding-top:40px}.contact h3{margin-top:40px}@media(max-width:767px){.contact{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style>
